 "The size of the cut against ",
 Cell[BoxData["k"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4bb14a47-dd47-444d-97cd-ace102868c1e"],
 ", from minus the radius to the radius: the negative half repeats the \
positive one, read from the outside in."
}], "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"5bcfed8b-5ffe-4756-a1be-a900b2e7f786"],

